---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
import CsvToSql from '../../components/CsvToSql.jsx';
---
<ToolLayout title="CSV to SQL INSERT Converter" description="Paste CSV data and generate ready-to-run SQL INSERT statements.">
  <CsvToSql client:load slot="tool" />
  <h2>Common use case</h2>
  <p>You've got a spreadsheet export and need it in a database fast — this skips manually writing INSERT statements by hand.</p>

  <h2>Common mistakes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Not escaping special characters in string values</strong>, which can break the generated SQL or introduce injection risk if not handled properly.</li>
    <li><strong>Running thousands of individual INSERT statements</strong> instead of a single batched multi-row INSERT for better performance on large datasets.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Use cases</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Importing spreadsheet data into a database table quickly</li>
    <li>Seeding a test database with data exported from another source</li>
    <li>Converting exported data for a one-time migration task</li>
  </ul>
</ToolLayout>
